  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Minimal running instrument",
    "overview": "Version 0.4 keeps monotone controls, few words and one Tabler family. The active map fills the content area behind a bottom statistics/control island, or lower-left island in landscape. North-up zoom-18 following centers a GPS movement arrow in the unobscured map; initial heading and course after a new GPS segment remain neutral until reliable movement. Replay defaults to 1×. Ongoing notifications expose time/distance/pace and state-appropriate controls; Samsung Now bar support is not claimed. Ready/replay maps retain 240dp/300dp or compact 120dp/160dp heights. Bounded v0.4 API 34 checks covered heading/follow, notification controls, 1× replay and light/dark/large-font/landscape layouts. Detailed results and physical-device limitations remain in README.md.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Achromatic controls in paired day/night roles; real-color map imagery.",
      "One Tabler outline family with short labels and accessible icon actions.",
      "Full-content live map, reachable bottom island and a visible saved-run Strava toolbar action.",
      "Observed GPS replay with explicit missing-data gaps and estimated measurements.",
      "Flat native lists and local route overlays, with visible map attribution.",
      "State-appropriate ongoing notification controls; Android/user settings, including silent-notification visibility, govern lock-screen presentation."
